WEBVTT

00:00:00.103 --> 00:00:05.756
This query starts from patients and left joins
admissions The patient

00:00:05.782 --> 00:00:11.531
table contributes one descriptive row per patient
Admissions provides

00:00:11.558 --> 00:00:17.242
the events being counted Filtered counts create
January February

00:00:17.465 --> 00:00:23.211
and March admission columns The GROUP BY keeps one
output row per patient

00:00:24.942 --> 00:00:28.981
Because the join relationship is understood the
counts remain meaningful
